{"format":2,"manifest":{"tmApi":1,"id":"openai-api-credit","name":{"en":"OpenAI API Credits","zh-TW":"OpenAI API Credits","zh-CN":"OpenAI API Credits","ja":"OpenAI API Credits","ko":"OpenAI API Credits","pt-BR":"OpenAI API Credits"},"description":{"en":"Read actual Platform API credit using manually supplied session credentials.","zh-TW":"使用手動提供的 Platform 登入憑證讀取實際 API 點數餘額。","zh-CN":"使用手动提供的 Platform 登录凭证读取实际 API 点数余额。","ja":"手動で入力した Platform のログイン認証情報で、実際の API クレジット残高を取得します。","ko":"직접 입력한 Platform 로그인 자격 증명으로 실제 API 크레딧 잔액을 조회합니다.","pt-BR":"Consulte o saldo real de créditos da API com credenciais de sessão do Platform inseridas manualmente."},"version":"0.1.0","ui":"settings.mjs","backend":"backend.cjs","files":["backend.cjs","balance.cjs","settings.mjs","i18n.mjs","LICENSE","README.md","README.zh-TW.md","README.zh-CN.md","README.ja.md","README.ko.md","README.pt-BR.md","CHANGELOG.md","CHANGELOG.zh-TW.md","CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md","CHANGELOG.ja.md","CHANGELOG.ko.md","CHANGELOG.pt-BR.md","assets/limits.png"],"views":[{"id":"preferences","title":{"en":"Balance display","zh-TW":"餘額顯示方式","zh-CN":"余额显示方式","ja":"残高の表示方法","ko":"잔액 표시 방식","pt-BR":"Exibição do saldo"},"surfaces":["settings"]}],"settings":{"version":1,"fields":[{"id":"displayMode","type":"select","label":{"en":"Balance display","zh-TW":"餘額顯示方式","zh-CN":"余额显示方式","ja":"残高の表示方法","ko":"잔액 표시 방식","pt-BR":"Exibição do saldo"},"default":"bar","options":[{"value":"bar","label":{"en":"Progress bar and balance","zh-TW":"進度條及餘額","zh-CN":"进度条及余额","ja":"プログレスバーと残高","ko":"진행률 표시줄과 잔액","pt-BR":"Barra de progresso e saldo"}},{"value":"balance","label":{"en":"Balance only","zh-TW":"純餘額","zh-CN":"仅余额","ja":"残高のみ","ko":"잔액만","pt-BR":"Apenas saldo"}}],"description":{"en":"The bar uses grants that still contain usable credit. When no reliable total exists, only the balance is shown.","zh-TW":"進度條只計仍有可用餘額的點數；總額資料不足時只顯示餘額。","zh-CN":"进度条仅计算仍有可用余额的点数；总额信息不足时只显示余额。","ja":"バーには利用可能な残高があるクレジットのみを含めます。総額を確認できない場合は残高のみを表示します。","ko":"표시줄에는 사용 가능한 잔액이 있는 크레딧만 포함됩니다. 총액을 확인할 수 없으면 잔액만 표시합니다.","pt-BR":"A barra considera apenas créditos com saldo utilizável. Quando não há um total confiável, apenas o saldo é exibido."}}]},"limits":[{"id":"credits","name":"OpenAI","capabilities":["api","web"],"settingsView":"preferences","credentials":{"fields":[{"id":"sessionBearer","label":"Platform session token","control":"input","required":true},{"id":"organization","label":"Organization ID","control":"input","required":true}],"validation":true}}],"presentation":{"icon":{"native":"codex"},"color":{"palette":"codex"}},"author":"Javis603","homepage":"https://github.com/Javis603/token-monitor","engines":{"tokenMonitor":">=0.88.0"}},"files":{"backend.cjs":"","balance.cjs":"","settings.mjs":"","i18n.mjs":"","LICENSE":"","README.md":"","README.zh-TW.md":"","README.zh-CN.md":"","README.ja.md":"","README.ko.md":"","README.pt-BR.md":"","CHANGELOG.md":"","CHANGELOG.zh-TW.md":"","CHANGELOG.zh-CN.md":"","CHANGELOG.ja.md":"","CHANGELOG.ko.md":"","CHANGELOG.pt-BR.md":"","assets/limits.png":""}}